The store also distributes JoJo water-storage and pump products locally, giving customers access to tanks, water filters and pump solutions alongside everyday building materials. It serves builders, tradespeople and homeowners in Ga Thoka, Mankweng and the surrounding communities looking for a single local hardware stop for construction and water-storage needs.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://thebuildingco.com/store/buco-ga-thoka/', '$[#]', 'https://www.jojo.co.za/distributor/buco-ga-toka/', '$[#]', 'https://www.citizen.co.za/review-online/news-headlines/local-news/2022/11/24/first-birthday-celebrations-for-buco-hardware-ga-thoka/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'buco-ga-thoka-mankweng' AND description = 'BUCO Ga Thoka is a hardware and building supplies store on the R71 in Ga Thoka, Mankweng, stocking building materials, tools, electrical and plumbing supplies for contractors and DIY customers; it opened in November 2021.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
