The business says it treats each material with professionalism to bring out its inner beauty. Its website advises buyers to make sure a diamond is certified, and to ask for a certificate from a recognised laboratory such as International Diamond Laboratories. The business operates two branches in Polokwane and a third in Mokopane, Limpopo, and this listing is in Fauna Park.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://debbiemoutonjewellers.co.za'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'debbie-mouton-jewellers-fauna-park' AND description = 'Debbie Mouton Jewellers is an independent Polokwane jewellery retailer offering custom-made and hand-picked jewellery and premium watch brands including TAG Heuer, Rado and Raymond Weil, along with valuations and repairs, at its Savannah Mall store.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
